- TH 1–2/52 to review LFT/FBC and, if OK, commence terbinafine (eScript)  
- Review ~6/52 after starting (TH or F2F) + repeat LFTs  
- F2F ~3/12 after start to assess nail growth; consider derm referral if no proximal clear nail or worsening  
- Book separate long appt 2–4/52 for shoulder/sleep/bowels etc  

